2.—(1) Sections 22(1) and 23(1) of the Act do not apply to any person who, within Singapore, possesses for sale, sells, or offers for sale any of the following substances, including any mixture containing any such substances:
(a)1,1,1,2,2,3,4,5,5,5-decafluoropentane;
(b)1,1,1,2,2,3-hexafluoropropane;
(c)1,1,1,2,3,3,3-heptafluoropropane;
(d)1,1,1,2,3,3-hexafluoropropane;
(e)1,1,1,2-tetrafluoroethane;
(f)1,1,1,3,3,3-hexafluoropropane;
(g)1,1,1,3,3-pentafluorobutane;
(h)1,1,1,3,3-pentafluoropropane;
(i)1,1,1-trifluoroethane;
(j)1,1,2,2,3-pentafluoropropane;
(k)1,1,2,2-tetrafluoroethane;
(l)1,1,2-trifluoroethane;
(m)1,1-difluoroethane;
(n)1,2-difluoroethane;
(o)Difluoromethane;
(p)Fluoromethane (methyl fluoride);
(q)Pentafluoroethane;
(r)Trifluoromethane.
(2) In this paragraph, sale does not include import or export.
